# Triage Cam reads its environment per app. Nothing is read from this file.
#
#   apps/web/.env.example     -> copy to apps/web/.env.local
#       DATABASE_URL, APP_URL, RESEND_API_KEY, EMAIL_FROM, EXPO_ACCESS_TOKEN,
#       SITTING_FILES_DIR, NEXT_DIST_DIR
#
#   apps/mobile/.env.example  -> copy to apps/mobile/.env.local
#       EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL
#
# A variable set in the shell wins over the .env.local file, which is how each agent runs its
# own dev server:  NEXT_DIST_DIR=.next-3101 PORT=3101 pnpm dev:web
#
# Never put a real key in an .env.example file.
